gn=\"middle\" width=\"520\" height=\"22\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; MARGIN-RIGHT: 6pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><strong>&nbsp;2010. 09. 27(월) ~ 09. 30(목) 17:00까지</strong></span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.7pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.7pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"135\" height=\"22\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><strong>10월부터 계속</strong></span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.7pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.7pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"520\" height=\"22\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; MARGIN-RIGHT: 6pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><strong>&nbsp;지원 종료</strong></span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n    </tbody>\n</table>\n<p></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 6pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">5. 선발조건 및 제출서류</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\">\n</p><table style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse\" cellspacing=\"0\" ce