e0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; MARGIN-RIGHT: 6pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;2) 응시분 인정 날짜 </span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; MARGIN-RIGHT: 6pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;2010년 3월 ~ 2010년 8월 응시분까지</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; MARGIN-RIGHT: 6pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;(선발일 이후 응시분부터 지원가능)</span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.7pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.7pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"97\" height=\"95\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">제출서류</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.7pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.7pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"562\" colspan=\"2\" height=\"95\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; MARGIN-RIGHT: 6pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;1. 장학금 신청서 (첨부파일 다운로드)</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; MARGIN-RIGHT: 6pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;<strong> </strong></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><strong>- 신청서 상단에 참여학생 선발 학기 및 토익 응시일 기재</strong></span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; MARGIN-RIGHT: 6pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;2. 본인 또는 학부모 통장사본</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; MARGIN-RIGHT: 6pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;3. 공인어학성적표 <strong>(</strong></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><strong>원본제출) - 원본대조확인</strong></span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n    </tbody>\n</table>\n<p></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: -2pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: -1pt\">6. 유의사항</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: -1pt\">1. 2010-1학기 장학금입니다.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: -1pt\">2. 2010년 8월 응시분까지만 지원</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: -1pt\">3. 9월말까지만 접수가능, 이후에는 지원을 하지 않습니다. </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">7. 장학금 신청 제한</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 미등록자</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 직전학기에 징계처분을 받은 자 또는 현재 징계처분 중인 자</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: -2.8pt\">다.&nbsp; 해당학기에 휴학(등록후 휴학자 포함),자퇴, 제적 등으로 장학생 자격 을 상실한자</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: -3.6pt\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;라. 8학기 이상 학기 초과자 및 학사경고를 받은 자&nbsp; </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt\"></span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 1.5pt\"></span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: -2.8pt\">마. </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: -2.1pt\">참여학생 요건(학기당 10시간 이상 프로그램 참여)에 미치지 못할 경우 장학금을 환수함<br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;바. 중복수혜원칙</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\">\n</p><table style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"1\">\n    <tbody>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.7pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.4pt double\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"173\" bgcolor=\"#ccffff\" height=\"29\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">구분</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.7pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.4pt double\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"482\" bgcolor=\"#ccffff\" height=\"29\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">내용</span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.7pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.4pt double; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"173\" height=\"86\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">그린에너지</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">어학성적장려금</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.1pt double; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.7pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"482\" height=\"86\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: -1pt\">- 사업기간동안 1인 1회에 한하여 지급</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: -1pt\">- 이전에 수혜 받은 학생은 지원할 수 없음</span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.7pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.7pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"173\" height=\"71\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">교내장학금</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.7pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.7pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"482\" height=\"71\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: -1pt\">- 교내장학금과 중복가능</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: -1pt\">- </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: -1pt\"><strong>교내영어성적우수장학금 수혜자는 장학금 신청 불가</strong></span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.7pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.7pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.7pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"173\" height=\"60\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">교육역량강화사업</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">장학금</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.7pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.7pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.7pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"482\" height=\"60\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">- 등록금 초과하면 선발에서 제외</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">- </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><strong>어학장려장학금 수혜자는 장학금 신청불가</strong></span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.7pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.7pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.7pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"173\" height=\"48\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">한국장학재단 관련 장학금</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.7pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.7pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.7pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"482\" height=\"48\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt\">- 등록금을 초과하면 선발에서 제외</span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.7pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"655\" colspan=\"2\" height=\"34\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><strong><u>** 어학성적 관련 장학금과는 일체 중복 불가</u></strong></span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n    </tbody>\n</table>\n<p></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 46.8pt; TEXT-INDENT: -46.8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\"></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 31.7pt; TEXT-INDENT: -31.7pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 31.7pt; TEXT-INDENT: -31.7pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt\">2010. 07. 20</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 31.8pt; TEXT-INDENT: -31.8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 학생과장<br><br></span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
